  "trust": "local",
  "description": "Erica Synths PĒRKONS HD-01 four-voice drum machine and synthesizer: the eight knobs and three switches of each voice, as its manual's MIDI implementation chart gives them in SINGLE MIDI CHANNEL mode.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "PĒRKONS HD-01 User Manual (December 2024)",
      "notes": "MIDI chart (page 35 of the PDF) read by tools/profiles/erica/import-erica.mjs from PERKONS_manual_10_26.pdf (sha256 57f3a8aeedd0fb81824d6d04689835212f7adf5a30e8894ec5a02f49d91e5e82), https://www.ericasynths.lv/service/file/download/product_id/1167/file_id/666/ (the manual on https://www.ericasynths.lv/perkons-hd-01-black-2520/). Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/erica/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/erica/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a controller of the manual's MIDI chart, with the name it prints, grouped by the voice it belongs to. The chart prints no values: each is 0 - 127. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "The chart is for SINGLE MIDI CHANNEL mode, every voice on the one channel with controllers of its own. In MULTI MIDI CHANNEL mode each voice has a channel of its own and answers to Voice 1's controllers; set the channel variable to the voice's channel and use the Voice 1 group.",
    "The assignment can be changed in the SYSTEM folder's single-midi-cc.json on the SD card; the profile follows the manual's chart."
  ],
  "variables": {
    "channel": 1
  },
